    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After waking up in a deep, dark forest, the two follow an unidentified girl into an old hospital. They must avoid enemies in the labyrinth, find a diary, reveal their hidden past, and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two-player cooperative play</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/4e09e8a670b5e5444d0b480453e6c579.poster.avif?t=1755030498\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/4e09e8a670b5e5444d0b480453e6c579.webm?t=1755030498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/4e09e8a670b5e5444d0b480453e6c579.mp4?t=1755030498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wear different masks with friends and work together with different abilities to avoid enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rabbits can hear things that are not heard or further away, and owls can see things that are invisible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Map that changes every time</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/3d4a09538457fd057bdd3ee716521420.poster.avif?t=1755030498\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/3d4a09538457fd057bdd3ee716521420.webm?t=1755030498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/3d4a09538457fd057bdd3ee716521420.mp4?t=1755030498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex labyrinths are randomly repositioned with each play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finding the way is very difficult, so you can feel like you're wandering in a real mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Enemies</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/467fc7585fd8887b6369954fd5abffb9.poster.avif?t=1755030498\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/467fc7585fd8887b6369954fd5abffb9.webm?t=1755030498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/467fc7585fd8887b6369954fd5abffb9.mp4?t=1755030498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there are several monsters in the labyrinth, such as wandering monsters, monsters that suddenly pop out of hiding. Survive by running away from various monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Items</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/934d5c3c942c7022240f2cf53e43b90c.poster.avif?t=1755030498\" width=614 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/934d5c3c942c7022240f2cf53e43b90c.webm?t=1755030498\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693270/extras/934d5c3c942c7022240f2cf53e43b90c.mp4?t=1755030498\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are various items hidden in cabinets, drawers, and bookshelves to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items that fit the situation and survive for a long time</p>",
